meta {
  name: Notification levels - Set
  type: http
  seq: 163
}

put {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/communities/nswswk8w8wso0ko8owwk8k0w/spaces/<cuid of a space>/notification-level
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "level": "mine"
  }
}

docs {
  Choose a level for a space (#1475): all (Everything), mine (Only what is for me) or none (Muted). Muted gives the member nothing from the space, a mention included, and deletes their open notifications of the space. Everything exists for discussion spaces and chat spaces only (422 for another type). An unknown level gives 400. Needs notifications:write.
}
